OL,3,GNEWSALightning strike 'like a bomb'
OL,4,Ahits island homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lightning strike sparked a fire at a
OL,7,Fhouse and damaged several other homes,
OL,8,Fforcing residents to leave.
OL,10,FFirefighters, police and ambulance
OL,11,Fcrews were called to Shepherds Croft on
OL,12,FPortland, Dorset, shortly after 21:35
OL,13,FGMT on Tuesday.
OL,15,FFour people had to leave a home that
OL,16,Fsuffered structural damage while
OL,17,Fanother building's porch caught fire
OL,18,Fand a telegraph pole was also hit, the
OL,19,Ffire service said. No injuries have
OL,20,Fbeen reported.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
