OL,3,GNEWSALightning strike 'like a bomb'
OL,4,Ahits island homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FLinda Hutton, whose home was affected,
OL,7,Fsaid: "It was like a bomb going off.
OL,8,FI've never heard a bang like it."
